# Run folders (eval/e1/README.md "What is committed"). Only small files are committed:
# the batch manifest, each run's summary, its final diff (capped at 64 KB) and its attempt log.
# Agent transcripts, stderr, Codex session copies and judge.json (which repeats the verify
# trace already in the run record) stay local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!batch.json
!run.json
!final.diff
!attempts.json
